{"urn": "anonymi-in-artem-rhetoricam.peri-schematon-hon-hermogenes-emnemoneusen", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "704.11", "text": "Περίοδος· „ὁ γὰρ οἷς ἂν ἐγὼ ληφθείην, ταῦτα"}
{"urn": "anonymi-in-artem-rhetoricam.peri-schematon-hon-hermogenes-emnemoneusen", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "704.12", "text": "„πράττων καὶ κατασκευαζόμενος, οὗτος ἐμοὶ πολεμεῖ,"}
{"urn": "anonymi-in-artem-rhetoricam.peri-schematon-hon-hermogenes-emnemoneusen", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "704.13", "text": "„κἂν μήπω βάλλῃ, μηδὲ τοξεύῃ.“"}
{"urn": "anonymi-in-artem-rhetoricam.peri-schematon-hon-hermogenes-emnemoneusen", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "704.14", "text": "Κωλικὸν ἐν ταύτῳ δὲ καὶ κομματικόν· „ἀλλ’ ὁ"}
