{"urn": "anonymi-in-artem-rhetoricam.peri-schematon-hon-hermogenes-emnemoneusen", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "705.14", "text": "ὁ τὴν Εὐβοίαν, 9 καὶ τὰ ἐξῆς"}
{"urn": "anonymi-in-artem-rhetoricam.peri-schematon-hon-hermogenes-emnemoneusen", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "705.15", "text": "Ἄκμαῖον τὸ προειρημένον πνευματικόν."}
{"urn": "anonymi-in-artem-rhetoricam.peri-schematon-hon-hermogenes-emnemoneusen", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "705.16", "text": "Καταφορά·"}
{"urn": "anonymi-in-artem-rhetoricam.peri-schematon-hon-hermogenes-emnemoneusen", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "705.17", "text": "Τί δὲ λαὸν ἀνίγκυεν 10 ἐνθάδ’ ἀγείρας"}
{"urn": "anonymi-in-artem-rhetoricam.peri-schematon-hon-hermogenes-emnemoneusen", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "705.18", "text": "Ἄτρεϊδης ; ἢ οὐχ Ἑλίνης ἔνεκ’ ἡὑκόμιο;"}
{"urn": "anonymi-in-artem-rhetoricam.peri-schematon-hon-hermogenes-emnemoneusen", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "705.19", "text": "ἢ μοῖνοι φιλέονσ’ ἀλόχους μερόπων ἀνθρώπων."}
{"urn": "anonymi-in-artem-rhetoricam.peri-schematon-hon-hermogenes-emnemoneusen", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "705.20", "text": "Διλήμματον· „παρῆς τούτοις λεγομένοις, καὶ"}
{"urn": "anonymi-in-artem-rhetoricam.peri-schematon-hon-hermogenes-emnemoneusen", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "705.21", "text": "συννηφραῖνον, 11 ἢ οὐ παρῆς· εἰ μὲν παρῆς, πῶς 12"}
