{"urn": "anonymi-in-artem-rhetoricam.peri-schematon-hon-hermogenes-emnemoneusen", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "705.23", "text": "δίκης ἀξιος εἰ, τοῖς ἀγαθοῖς τῆς πόλεως μὴ συμπαρών.“"}
{"urn": "anonymi-in-artem-rhetoricam.peri-schematon-hon-hermogenes-emnemoneusen", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "705.24", "text": "Παρήχησις·"}
{"urn": "anonymi-in-artem-rhetoricam.peri-schematon-hon-hermogenes-emnemoneusen", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "705.25", "text": "ἦτοι ὁ καππεδίων τὸ Ἀλίμιον οἷος ἄλᾶτο,"}
{"urn": "anonymi-in-artem-rhetoricam.peri-schematon-hon-hermogenes-emnemoneusen", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "705.26", "text": "ὃν θυμὸν κατεῖδον, πάτον 13 ἀνθρώπων ἀλείειων."}
{"urn": "anonymi-in-artem-rhetoricam.peri-schematon-hon-hermogenes-emnemoneusen", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "705.27", "text": "6 Mon. παραστράτον. Ven. 1. παρὰ στράτον. Ven. 2. παρὰ"}
{"urn": "anonymi-in-artem-rhetoricam.peri-schematon-hon-hermogenes-emnemoneusen", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "705.28", "text": "A Ven. 1. εἰς θάλασσαν abest. 8 Ven. 1. 2. ἑαυτόν. — pro"}
{"urn": "anonymi-in-artem-rhetoricam.peri-schematon-hon-hermogenes-emnemoneusen", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "705.29", "text": "λαὸν ἀνίγειρεν ἐνθάδ’ Ἄτρεϊδης. — Il. ι. 338. 11 καὶ συννηφρ."}
